  "title": "Turn Switches On/Off When the Game Starts [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "ゲーム起動時にスイッチをオン・オフする【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "233ceb50d5570943a72b203c573bc24c7eb65dab795aa8fa71427f10dfa481f4",
      "translation": "Turn Switches On/Off When the Game Starts [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "233ceb50d5570943a72b203c573bc24c7eb65dab795aa8fa71427f10dfa481f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ゲーム起動時に指定したスイッチをオン・オフします。",
      "sourceHash": "69f38fbcb93eea47275dfe509a6566c5866baaa1bfd995e3e990aa78a4ef1ebf",
      "translation": "Turn specified switches on or off when the game starts.",
      "contextHash": "69f38fbcb93eea47275dfe509a6566c5866baaa1bfd995e3e990aa78a4ef1ebf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※起動時にはコンティニューも含みます。",
      "sourceHash": "9ca8135c1cfffbfffdcef7d7492462aa0ab1af47d0df150a6ef389cac4fb71e2",
      "translation": "※This also includes continuing from a save file.",
      "contextHash": "9ca8135c1cfffbfffdcef7d7492462aa0ab1af47d0df150a6ef389cac4fb71e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "主にプロジェクト毎による処理の切替を想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "c2dc79800f9123ba30b35f7cc9e62c6601006f661dc6376c8b831d5f67158373",
      "translation": "This is mainly intended to switch processing for each project.",
      "contextHash": "c2dc79800f9123ba30b35f7cc9e62c6601006f661dc6376c8b831d5f67158373"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "例えば、体験版の場合だけオンになるスイッチを作成し、体験版専用のナビゲーションメッセージを表示できます。",
      "sourceHash": "4d3607dfdaa914bf36f4b725d72ac3bc9e172d54b503421edb221a940b7294c7",
      "translation": "For example, you can create a switch that is turned on only in the trial version and display navigation messages specifically for the trial version.",
      "contextHash": "4d3607dfdaa914bf36f4b725d72ac3bc9e172d54b503421edb221a940b7294c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、体験版のセーブデータを製品版に引き継いだ際に、該当のスイッチをオフにするようにできます。",
      "sourceHash": "cd911945d46269250f214994e1a341dab9e8fc102fec9c952f2339535cfdd6fe",
      "translation": "You can also turn the relevant switch off when transferring trial version save data to the full version.",
      "contextHash": "cd911945d46269250f214994e1a341dab9e8fc102fec9c952f2339535cfdd6fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Enable the feature from the Plugin Manager in RPG Maker.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "NRP_ProjectSwitch.js",
      "sourceHash": "fc33c12061fb09e0de489ee1dc6c2cba7ff9ee391842e1abd54700ed4afa13d6",
      "translation": "NRP_ProjectSwitch.js ",
      "contextHash": "6165048e6570492aea78573c76cdabf4a0dd596d3e9574ed51ba123e05d0153a"
    },
